> Using Spans

```catala-metadata
#[test]
#[testcase.testui]
#[testcase.test_description = ""]
#[testcase.test_title = "A span of more than one unit"]
declaration scope Span_multi:
  output s scope Spans.Span
```

```catala
scope Span_multi:
  definition s.len equals 1 year + 2 month + 3 day
  assertion (s.ok = true)
```
